<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4702" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλυκτάζω</span></b> , (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλύω</span>) only impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wander distraught,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
				10.93
			</span></i>; <i>to be distressed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				9.70
			</span></i>:—also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλυκτέω</span></b> , <i>to be in distress, anguish,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">Erot.,
					<u>EM</u>71.38</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>: aor.
			part.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλυκτήσας</span> in act. sense, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θορυβήσας</span>
			, <i><span class="en">Hsch.,
					<u>EM</u>71.39</span></i>; cf.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλαλύκτημαι.</span></div>
